    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const {\n  departureLocation,\n  destinationCity,\n  accommodationType,\n  amenities,\n  bedrooms,\n  bathrooms,\n  startDate,\n  endDate,\n  tripType,\n  groupSize,\n  ageRange,\n  budget,\n  email\n} = $json;\nconsole.log('Preparing prompt with departureLocation:', departureLocation);\nreturn [{ json: {\n  departureLocation,\n  destinationCity,\n  accommodationType,\n  amenities,\n  bedrooms,\n  bathrooms,\n  startDate,\n  endDate,\n  tripType,\n  groupSize,\n  ageRange,\n  budget,\n  email,\n  prompt: `You are an experienced and helpful AI travel agent specializing in Airbnb and hotel stays. Your goal is to create exciting, practical, and well-organized travel itineraries tailored to each user's preferences. Be friendly, informative, and concise.\n- Departure Location: ${departureLocation}\n- Destination: ${destinationCity}\n- Accommodation Type: ${accommodationType}\n- Key Amenities: ${Array.isArray(amenities) ? amenities.join(', ') : amenities || 'Not specified'}\n- Number of Bedrooms: ${bedrooms}\n- Number of Bathrooms: ${bathrooms}\n- Travel Dates: ${startDate} to ${endDate}\n- Trip Type: ${tripType}\n- Group Size: ${groupSize}\n- Age Ranges: ${Array.isArray(ageRange) ? ageRange.join(', ') : ageRange || 'Not specified'}\n- Budget: $${budget}\n\nCreate a complete itinerary for this trip focusing on an Airbnb or hotel stay. Include recommendations for:\n1. Flights (specific airlines and routes from ${departureLocation || 'the nearest major airport'} to ${destinationCity}, with estimated costs)\n2. Accommodation options (specific Airbnb listings or hotels matching the accommodation type, amenities, and room preferences; include estimated cost per night and total cost for the trip, and provide at least one alternative option)\n3. Daily schedule with activities, dining options, and sights (include morning, afternoon, and evening plans for each day)\n4. Estimated food budget (daily cost and recommendations for dining, considering local cuisine)\n5. A cost summary table (flights, accommodation, activities, food, total, and remaining budget). This section is mandatory and must always be included. If no costs are available, use placeholder values (e.g., Flights\\t$0). Ensure the table includes all categories: Flights, Accommodation, Activities, Food, Total, and Remaining Budget, in that order.\n6. Travel tips specific to the destination and Airbnb/hotel experience\n\nRespond in a clean and organized layout with sections. Include hyperlinks to Airbnb listings, hotels, activities, or dining options where relevant, using <a href=\"URL\">Description</a> format. Use real, functional URLs where users can book or learn more (e.g., Airbnb, hotel websites, attraction sites). Do not use placeholder URLs like \"https://example.com\". Ensure the Cost Summary section is formatted as a tab-separated table (e.g., Flights\\t$1,000).` }\n}];"
      },
      "name": "Prepare Airbnb Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        600,
        120
      ],
      "id": "23cbff16-c57b-4e3d-9ed1-8f6e753eb4b2"
    },
